## Scenario 1: Initial App Load → Random Card

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant FloatingNavBar
    participant useScryfallCardsSearch
    participant QueryClient as React Query<br/>QueryClient
    participant ScryfallAPI as Scryfall API<br/>(cards/random)
    participant CardsList

    User->>Browser: Load app (/)
    Browser->>App: Render App
    App->>App: location.pathname = "/"
    App->>App: Redirect to /random
    App->>useScryfallCardsSearch: useScryfallCardsSearch("cards/random", {format: json}, seedParam)
    useScryfallCardsSearch->>QueryClient: Check cache: queryKey ["scryfallCards", "cards/random", ...]
    alt Cache Miss
        QueryClient->>ScryfallAPI: GET /cards/random?format=json
        ScryfallAPI-->>QueryClient: Return random card
        QueryClient->>QueryClient: Store in cache (staleTime: 24h)
    else Cache Hit
        QueryClient-->>QueryClient: Return cached card
    end
    useScryfallCardsSearch-->>App: { data: card[], isLoading }
    App->>FloatingNavBar: Pass isLoading, onRandomRequest
    App->>CardsList: Render CardsList (/random route)
    CardsList->>CardsList: Map scryfallCards to Card components
    CardsList-->>User: Display random card(s)

