## Scenario 2: User Searches by Card Name

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FloatingNavBar
    participant Browser
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant useScryfallCardsSearch
    participant QueryClient as React Query
    participant ScryfallAPI as Scryfall API<br/>(cards/search)
    participant CardsList

    User->>FloatingNavBar: Type "Counterspell" in search
    User->>FloatingNavBar: Submit search (press Enter)
    FloatingNavBar->>FloatingNavBar: query = "Counterspell"
    FloatingNavBar->>Browser: navigate("/cards/Counterspell")
    Browser->>App: location.pathname = "/cards/Counterspell"
    App->>App: Extract searchQuery = "Counterspell"
    App->>useScryfallCardsSearch: useScryfallCardsSearch("cards/search", {q: "Counterspell", format: json}, 0)
    useScryfallCardsSearch->>QueryClient: Check cache: queryKey ["scryfallCards", "cards/search", {q: "Counterspell"...}]
    alt Cache Miss
        QueryClient->>ScryfallAPI: GET /cards/search?q=Counterspell&format=json
        ScryfallAPI-->>QueryClient: Return search results (multiple cards)
        QueryClient->>QueryClient: Store in cache (staleTime: 24h)
    else Cache Hit
        QueryClient-->>QueryClient: Return cached results
    end
    useScryfallCardsSearch-->>App: { data: card[], isLoading }
    App->>CardsList: Render CardsList (/cards/Counterspell route)
    CardsList->>CardsList: Map scryfallCards to Card components
    CardsList-->>User: Display search results

