## Scenario 3: Clicking a Card in the List to Open Overlay

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CardsList
    participant Card as Card Component
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant Browser
    participant useScryfallCardsSearch
    participant QueryClient as React Query
    participant ScryfallAPI as Scryfall API<br/>(cards/:id)
    participant CardOverlay

    User->>Card: Click on a card
    Card->>CardsList: onSelect(card.id)
    CardsList->>CardsList: Call onCardSelect(card.id) from OutletContext
    CardsList->>App: onCardSelect(id) handler called
    App->>App: setSelectedCardId(id)
    App->>Browser: navigate("/card/{cardId}", {state: {fromList: true}})
    Browser->>App: location.pathname = "/card/{cardId}"
    App->>App: Extract cardMatch, routeCardId
    alt Card not in current search results
        App->>useScryfallCardsSearch: useScryfallCardsSearch("cards/{cardId}", {}, 0)
        useScryfallCardsSearch->>QueryClient: Check cache: queryKey ["scryfallCards", "cards/{cardId}"...]
        alt Cache Miss
            QueryClient->>ScryfallAPI: GET /cards/{cardId}?format=json
            ScryfallAPI-->>QueryClient: Return single card
            QueryClient->>QueryClient: Store in cache (staleTime: 24h)
        else Cache Hit
            QueryClient-->>QueryClient: Return cached card
        end
        useScryfallCardsSearch-->>App: { data: card[], isLoading }
    end
    App->>CardOverlay: Render CardOverlay with card data
    CardOverlay-->>User: Display card details overlay

