## Scenario 4: Deep Link to Card (/card/:cardId)

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant useScryfallCardsSearch
    participant QueryClient as React Query
    participant ScryfallAPI as Scryfall API
    participant CardOverlay

    User->>Browser: Navigate to /card/abc123 (from external link)
    Browser->>App: Render App with /card/abc123
    App->>App: Extract cardMatch, routeCardId = "abc123"
    App->>useScryfallCardsSearch: useScryfallCardsSearch("cards/abc123", {}, 0)
    useScryfallCardsSearch->>QueryClient: Check cache: queryKey ["scryfallCards", "cards/abc123"...]
    alt Cache Miss (First Visit)
        QueryClient->>ScryfallAPI: GET /cards/abc123?format=json
        ScryfallAPI-->>QueryClient: Return card data
        QueryClient->>QueryClient: Store in cache (staleTime: 24h)
    else Cache Hit
        QueryClient-->>QueryClient: Return cached card
    end
    useScryfallCardsSearch-->>App: { data: cardFromRoute[], isLoading }
    App->>App: effectiveCards = cardFromRoute (since no search results)
    App->>CardOverlay: Render CardOverlay with card data
    CardOverlay-->>User: Display card details overlay

