## Scenario 5: Card Overlay - Loading Rulings & Prints

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CardOverlay
    participant useFetchUrl as useFetchUrl Hook
    participant QueryClient as React Query
    participant ScryfallAPI as Scryfall API
    participant OracleText

    CardOverlay->>CardOverlay: Card loaded from parent
    CardOverlay->>useFetchUrl: useFetchUrl("cardRulings", card.rulings_uri)
    useFetchUrl->>QueryClient: Check cache: queryKey ["fetchedUrl", "cardRulings", card.rulings_uri]
    alt Cache Miss
        QueryClient->>ScryfallAPI: GET {rulings_uri}
        ScryfallAPI-->>QueryClient: Return rulings array
        QueryClient->>QueryClient: Store in cache (staleTime: 24h)
    else Cache Hit
        QueryClient-->>QueryClient: Return cached rulings
    end
    useFetchUrl-->>CardOverlay: { data: scryfallRulings }

    CardOverlay->>useFetchUrl: useFetchUrl("cardPrints", card.prints_search_uri)
    useFetchUrl->>QueryClient: Check cache: queryKey ["fetchedUrl", "cardPrints", card.prints_search_uri]
    alt Cache Miss
        QueryClient->>ScryfallAPI: GET {prints_search_uri}
        ScryfallAPI-->>QueryClient: Return prints array
        QueryClient->>QueryClient: Store in cache (staleTime: 24h)
    else Cache Hit
        QueryClient-->>QueryClient: Return cached prints
    end
    useFetchUrl-->>CardOverlay: { data: scryfallPrints }

    CardOverlay->>CardOverlay: Filter/validate prints (must have images)
    CardOverlay->>CardOverlay: Render rulings list
    CardOverlay->>OracleText: Render each ruling
    CardOverlay->>CardOverlay: Render prints gallery
    CardOverlay-->>User: Display rulings & prints

