## Scenario 6: Empty Search → Redirect to Random

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FloatingNavBar
    participant Browser
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant useScryfallCardsSearch
    participant QueryClient as React Query

    User->>FloatingNavBar: Press Enter with empty search field
    FloatingNavBar->>FloatingNavBar: query = ""
    FloatingNavBar->>FloatingNavBar: Call onRandomRequest()
    FloatingNavBar->>App: onRandomRequest() → setRandomSeed(Date.now())
    App->>App: randomSeed = new timestamp
    App->>useScryfallCardsSearch: useScryfallCardsSearch("cards/random", {format: json}, newSeedParam)
    note over useScryfallCardsSearch: New seed creates new queryKey,<br/>bypassing cache
    useScryfallCardsSearch->>QueryClient: queryKey: ["scryfallCards", "cards/random", newSeedParam]
    QueryClient->>QueryClient: Cache miss (new seed)
    useScryfallCardsSearch-->>App: Fetch new random card
    FloatingNavBar->>Browser: navigate("/random")
    Browser->>App: location updates
    App-->>User: Display new random card
